  "verificationScope": "# Original Hom-cokernel open restriction and framed geometric coefficient restriction\n\nLET j:Y->X be an ACTUAL open immersion of schemes,and d:Mprime->M,a:Mprime->N ACTUAL module-sheaf morphisms. No finite presentation or quasi-coherence is required for this open-restriction comparison. CONSTRUCT the actual internal-Hom restriction iso from original local linear maps and the original slice equivalence. DERIVE the source-differential square,the induced cokernel iso kappa,and SAME original quotient projection identity. PROVE kappa(j^*[curry(a)])=[curry(j^*a)],with the native structure-sheaf unit iso explicit.\n\nLET R be ANY commutative ring,T ANY R-module,p>=0,H:Fin(p+1)->R,and i:Spec(R/(H))->SpecR. For the SAME actual Koszul top Hom differential,CONSTRUCT its cokernel iso to ACTUAL i_*i^*tilde(T),using already PROVED arbitrary-coefficient exactness/epimorphy. Given ACTUAL source frames s:A~=tilde(exterior^(p+1)),t:B~=tilde(exterior^p),coefficient frame beta:M~=tilde(T),and ORIGINAL source differential square d;t=s;dKoszul,DERIVE the Hom square,cokernel comparison and SAME functional representative. Its image is the original geometric restriction g(curry(s.inv;a;beta.hom)). The required source frames and source differential square are EXPLICIT hypotheses of this generic framed statement. They are NOT supplied as Hom/cokernel/desired image certificates. No regular-sequence,field,Noetherian,flat,free or invertible condition on T is needed.\n\n23 independently audited declarations:15 ordinary theorems and8 object constructions;12 individually compiled roots,including4 revalidated pre-existing Hom restriction foundation modules. Full exact types,ALL8 definition bodies and semantic roles read. Only standard propext,Classical.choice,Quot.sound. All nonroot source bytes match earlier verified PUBLIC archives. Actual compiler ranges/constant edges for roots;prior public metadata only reused after live hashes and source bytes agree.\n\nOPEN:connect SAME actual geometric original Koszul chain/chart and source exterior-term frame to this generic computation;then actual original a|S and support formula. The later SchemeModuleChainOpenKoszulHomCokernel draft FAILED type comparison and is EXCLUDED. No general lambda isomorphism,proper duality/canonicaltheta or uniformm. Original4.1/4.2/main remain OPEN. Preserve original1<=r<n,d>=2,ONE NONEMPTY parameter open BEFORE ALLintegerk,and parameteru/c distinct from finalQ. The unverified4.1interface is NOTan axiom. Local freeness does not imply global projectivity;Hom full faithfulness does not imply Ext comparison. Whole verified local checkpoint180;181interrupted/notaccepted;no whole-project LeanCI.\n\nOne compiler8GiB WindowsJob,2threads,CPU<=25%,BelowNormal,20minutes;all90existingholds retained,no unchangedheld retry,no raised caps or extra agents. All taskfiles D. Automation03:30-10:00Asia/Shanghai. Lean4.35.0-rc3,pinnedmathlib2a885768dae569d938bb9ff3474da6a8753bb90a.\n",
